  "intro": {
    "title": "Gut, besser, am besten",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Gut means both 'good' and 'well': das Essen ist gut, du sprichst gut Deutsch. Its comparison is irregular, just like in English: gut, besser, am besten."
    ]
  },
